---
// Realtime Risk Engine Dual Path: Synchronous Decision vs Asynchronous Feature Pipeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="redp-diag" aria-labelledby="redp-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="redp-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 390"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="redp-diag-title redp-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="redp-diag-title">
      現代即時風控引擎同步決策與非同步特徵沉澱雙鏈路架構圖
    </title>
    <desc id="redp-diag-desc">
      展示支付請求發起經 50ms 內同步鏈路執行設備指紋、Redis
      滑動視窗、規則引擎與輕量 ML 評分進行放行、挑戰或阻斷；同時非同步發送 Kafka
      由 Flink 與圖資料庫沉澱社群特徵。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="redp-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="redp-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="redp-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="redp-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="redp-arrow-amber"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="redp-diag__arrow-head--amber"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="redp-arrow-red"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="redp-diag__arrow-head--red"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="360"
      rx="12"
      class="redp-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Step 1: Payment Request Ingress (x: 270, width: 340) -->
    <g transform="translate(270, 30)">
      <rect
        width="340"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="170"
        y="26"
        class="redp-diag__title redp-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        支付請求發起 (Payment Request Ingress)
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Downward Arrow with 50ms constraint badge -->
    <path
      d="M 440 72 L 440 108"
      class="redp-diag__path redp-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#redp-arrow-blue)"></path>
    <rect
      x="455"
      y="78"
      width="130"
      height="22"
      rx="4"
      class="redp-diag__badge-rect"></rect>
    <text x="520" y="93" class="redp-diag__badge-text" text-anchor="middle"
      >⚡ &lt; 50ms 同步約束</text
    >

    <!-- Step 2: Risk Decision Center Core (x: 50, y: 110, width: 780) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 110)">
      <rect
        width="780"
        height="96"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="390"
        y="26"
        class="redp-diag__title redp-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        【 API 閘道 ＋ 風控決策中台 (Real-Time Decision Core) 】
      </text>
      <rect
        x="25"
        y="38"
        width="730"
        height="46"
        rx="6"
        class="redp-diag__inner-box"></rect>
      <text x="390" y="56" class="redp-diag__desc-text" text-anchor="middle">
        • 設備指紋 (Canvas / WebGL Fingerprint) ｜ IP 威脅畫像 ｜ 帳號關聯歷史
      </text>
      <text x="390" y="74" class="redp-diag__desc-text" text-anchor="middle">
        • Redis 即時滑動視窗聚合特徵 ｜ Drools 動態規則引擎 ｜ XGBoost
        輕量評分模型
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- 3 Action Decision Branches -->
    <path
      d="M 180 206 L 180 236"
      class="redp-diag__path redp-diag__path--green"
      marker-end="url(#redp-arrow-green)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 440 206 L 440 236"
      class="redp-diag__path redp-diag__path--amber"
      marker-end="url(#redp-arrow-amber)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 700 206 L 700 236"
      class="redp-diag__path redp-diag__path--red"
      marker-end="url(#redp-arrow-red)"></path>

    <!-- Action 1: PASS (x: 50, width: 250) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 238)">
      <rect
        width="250"
        height="50"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="125"
        y="24"
        class="redp-diag__act-title redp-diag__act-title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ✅ 放行 (PASS)
      </text>
      <text x="125" y="40" class="redp-diag__act-sub" text-anchor="middle"
        >低風險 ➔ 直接放行扣款</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Action 2: CHALLENGE (x: 315, width: 250) -->
    <g transform="translate(315, 238)">
      <rect
        width="250"
        height="50"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--amber"></rect>
      <text
        x="125"
        y="24"
        class="redp-diag__act-title redp-diag__act-title--amber"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ⚠️ 挑戰 (CHALLENGE)
      </text>
      <text x="125" y="40" class="redp-diag__act-sub" text-anchor="middle"
        >中風險 ➔ 3DS / 簡訊 OTP 驗證</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Action 3: BLOCK (x: 580, width: 250) -->
    <g transform="translate(580, 238)">
      <rect
        width="250"
        height="50"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="125"
        y="24"
        class="redp-diag__act-title redp-diag__act-title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ❌ 阻斷 (BLOCK)
      </text>
      <text x="125" y="40" class="redp-diag__act-sub" text-anchor="middle"
        >高風險 ➔ 拒絕交易並告警</text
      >
    </g>

    <!-- Asynchronous Feature Pipeline (x: 50, y: 304, width: 780) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 306)">
      <rect
        width="780"
        height="48"
        rx="8"
        class="redp-diag__box redp-diag__box--async"></rect>
      <text x="390" y="22" class="redp-diag__async-title" text-anchor="middle">
        非同步特徵沉澱鏈路（Asynchronous Feature &amp; Graph Pipeline）
      </text>
      <text x="390" y="38" class="redp-diag__async-desc" text-anchor="middle">
        Kafka 事件匯流排 ➔ Flink 滑動視窗流聚合 ➔ Neo4j / GNN
        圖神經網路黑產團夥挖掘 ➔ 回寫 Redis 離線特徵
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="redp-diag__mobile">
    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--blue"
        >REQUEST INGRESS</span
      >
      <h4>1. 支付請求進入 API 閘道</h4>
      <p>
        交易發起，API 閘道必須在 <strong>50ms 內</strong> 同步完成全流程風控，絕不拖垮線上支付轉化率。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--purple"
        >SYNC DECISION</span
      >
      <h4>2. 即時風控中台決策引擎</h4>
      <p>
        • <strong>設備指紋：</strong>Canvas / WebGL / AudioContext
        逆向生成穩定設備 ID。
      </p>
      <p>
        • <strong>動態規則：</strong>Drools
        引擎毫秒級比對單日交易筆數、金額上限與黑名單。
      </p>
      <p>• <strong>輕量模型：</strong>XGBoost 模型預測欺詐機率評分。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--green"
        >DECISION: PASS</span
      >
      <h4>3A. 放行 (PASS) ➔ 正常扣款</h4>
      <p>評分低於安全閾值，即時放行呼叫銀行支付渠道。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--amber">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--amber"
        >DECISION: CHALLENGE</span
      >
      <h4>3B. 挑戰 (CHALLENGE) ➔ 二次驗證</h4>
      <p>觸發 3D-Secure、動態簡訊 OTP、人臉辨識或生物驗證。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--red"
        >DECISION: BLOCK</span
      >
      <h4>3C. 阻斷 (BLOCK) ➔ 拒絕交易</h4>
      <p>命中致命洗錢或盜刷規則，立即中斷交易並寫入黑名單。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="redp-mobile-card redp-mobile-card--async">
      <span class="redp-mobile-badge redp-mobile-badge--async"
        >ASYNC PIPELINE</span
      >
      <h4>4. 非同步特徵與圖神經網路沉澱</h4>
      <p>
        非同步將全量事件投遞 Kafka，透過 Flink 滑動視窗計算近 1h/24h
        頻次，並送入 Neo4j / GNN 圖譜挖掘黑產關聯團夥。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="redp-diag-caption" class="redp-diag__caption">
    圖一：現代即時風控引擎同步決策與非同步特徵沉澱雙鏈路架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
